SUMMARY:AI-Roundtable — Souveräne KI in Verwaltung und Unternehmen
LOCATION:BFH Departement Wirtschaft\, Raum H051\, Brückenstrasse 73\, Bern
DESCRIPTION:Half-day working roundtable at the Bern University of Applied S
 ciences on sovereign AI in public administration and business\, including 
 a six-dimension evaluation framework for AI agent harnesses\, change manag
 ement and breakout groups\, capped at around 50 places.\n\nOrganiser: Zent
 rum für Schweizerische Digitale Souveränität (Zentrum SDS) at BFH\n\nDe
 tails and registration: https://swissdataevents.ch/events/zentrum-sds-ai-r
 oundtable-bern-2026/
URL:https://swissdataevents.ch/events/zentrum-sds-ai-roundtable-bern-2026/
SEQUENCE:0
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:epi-winterschool-generative-ai-wengen-2027@swissdataevents.ch
DTSTAMP:20261128T140412Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270121
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270124
SUMMARY:Generative AI for Epidemiology Researchers: Practical Skills and Re
 sponsible Use
LOCATION:Wengen\, Bernese Oberland\, Wengen (Bern)
DESCRIPTION:A three-day course in Wengen on using generative AI responsibly
  in research\, pairing lectures with computer practicals on analysis\, lit
 erature searching\, scientific writing\, study websites and agentic AI —
  and on where error\, bias and reproducibility break down.\n\nOrganiser: S
 wiss Epidemiology Winter School\n\nDetails and registration: https://swiss
 dataevents.ch/events/epi-winterschool-generative-ai-wengen-2027/
URL:https://swissdataevents.ch/events/epi-winterschool-generative-ai-wengen
 -2027/
SEQUENCE:0
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
